  "releaseNotes": "10.2.1\n\n* Fixed: two uploads into the same new remote folder at once could make one of them fail. Upload\n  and UploadAsync create the folders above the file when they are missing, and a folder another\n  client created between the check and the create made the create throw. They now accept a folder\n  that exists by then.\n\n10.2.0 added SFtpClient.Rename and RenameAsync, and raised the dependency floors to 10.0.13:\nhttps://www.nuget.org/packages/Com.H.Net.Ssh/10.2.0#releasenotes-body-tab\n\nUpgrading from 10.0.x or 2.x? 10.1.0 merged the netstandard2.0 and net8.0+ packages into one and\nraised the dependency floors (including SSH.NET 2026.0.0). Its notes list every change:\nhttps://www.nuget.org/packages/Com.H.Net.Ssh/10.1.0#releasenotes-body-tab",
